### ============================================================
### 주문 API (인증 필요)
### ============================================================

### 주문 생성
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser1
X-Loopers-LoginPw: password123!

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### 주문 생성 (쿠폰 적용)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser1
X-Loopers-LoginPw: password123!

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 }
  ],
  "couponId": 1
}

### 내 주문 목록
GET {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders/me?startDate=2025-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31&page=0&size=20
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser1
X-Loopers-LoginPw: password123!

### 내 주문 상세
GET {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders/me/1
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser1
X-Loopers-LoginPw: password123!
